{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2b6d6e9b70642c4f50c2afa43c16a472.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">David sets out to take his mute daughter Sarah to her grandmother. However, when their path crosses with the Silvanis Forest, Sarah mysteriously runs off into the woods. While our ultimate goal is to find our daughter, the moment David steps into the forest, he realizes that a cursed presence lingers in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Our mission is to turn the darkness of the forest into light and find Sarah before any harm befalls her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/290f7d832316f790954e739c47a84126.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With an atmosphere both serene and filled with tension, Silvanis will carry you through a whirlwind of emotions. At times, you will find yourself peacefully wandering in the depths of the forest; at other times, you\u2019ll feel you are not alone in an abandoned house. But remember\u2026 you must always stay on guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/9cffdfa3619f40508911647ccc4cef0d.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silvanis combines psychological thriller elements with a variety of puzzle mechanics. By overcoming the obstacles in your path, you\u2019ll piece together the story and get closer to uncovering the mysteries of the forest. With visual, auditory, and logical puzzles, the thrill and suspense of this journey will never fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754050?t=1756807650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754050?t=1756807650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/808a71071fa26bf0025b127bcc2c9b95ef405d32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756807650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/808a71071fa26bf0025b127bcc2c9b95ef405d32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756807650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/97ce6847a3567f65ff55a946c59d4db2.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2b6d6e9b70642c4f50c2afa43c16a472.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">David sets out to take his mute daughter Sarah to her grandmother. However, when their path crosses with the Silvanis Forest, Sarah mysteriously runs off into the woods. While our ultimate goal is to find our daughter, the moment David steps into the forest, he realizes that a cursed presence lingers in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Our mission is to turn the darkness of the forest into light and find Sarah before any harm befalls her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/2a7cc5ded98c93df27908097b730d7e1.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/290f7d832316f790954e739c47a84126.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With an atmosphere both serene and filled with tension, Silvanis will carry you through a whirlwind of emotions. At times, you will find yourself peacefully wandering in the depths of the forest; at other times, you\u2019ll feel you are not alone in an abandoned house. But remember\u2026 you must always stay on guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.poster.avif?t=1756807650\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.webm?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/b569a0c47088c6b5d99ccd51eb39e29d.mp4?t=1756807650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/9cffdfa3619f40508911647ccc4cef0d.avif?t=1756807650\" data-has-big width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silvanis combines psychological thriller elements with a variety of puzzle mechanics. By overcoming the obstacles in your path, you\u2019ll piece together the story and get closer to uncovering the mysteries of the forest. With visual, auditory, and logical puzzles, the thrill and suspense of this journey will never fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Woblix Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/aa55dc8bca62accf16fd8cbbaf486ade2bee4171/header.jpg?t=1756807650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754050/1730770416/defe2bffd40a098433e72c6d4d0402bd96491f8f/1750658738/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750659916","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3754050/1730770416/defe2